.TH "libnvmf_exclusion_create" 9 "libnvmf_exclusion_create" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
libnvmf_exclusion_create \- create a new exclusion list.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "int" libnvmf_exclusion_create
.BI "(struct libnvme_global_ctx *ctx "  ","
.BI "const char *name "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "ctx" 12
libnvme global context; must not be NULL
.IP "name" 12
list name (used as filename: <dir>/<name>.conf)
.SH "RETURN"
0 on success, -EEXIST if the list already exists, negative errno otherwise.
